{"summary":"Mini-game collection.","description":"WHO IS AWESOME is a singleplayer mini-game collection, in which our the awesome character that you choose competes with the characters that you didn’t.\n\nFour characters from different games — Reaper from Peace, Death!, Vladimir from DRAW CHILLY, Knight from OH MY GOD, LOOK AT THIS KNIGHT!, and the Cowboy from Gun Done — sit at the same table and try to think faster than their opponents.\n\nThe game has only two rules\n- Rule number one: if you lose, the others will win.\n- Rule number two: if you win, the others will lose.\n\nFeatures\n- Many various games.\n- Tables that unlock even more games.\n- Rooms, each with different rules.\n- Cat named Juggernaut that doesn’t influence anything but your mood.\n\nAlso WHO IS AWESOME available with Google Play Pass!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7wJLAZgyuT4?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mc-gD4vcI8uDhz306lkrZVSZo3D7jcuAk7gCHH92XapfEZvN3LHDazBfH7GsX0sWJf-uhqpQq5vM6AEYOJ5emA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ml1Mna7rK4HEXruvFgSEGMD0vAjqCorON9dKdDRrjc9y0-O4AUinmihN07FsgGcod1SWxWLxcruICosCobeyr74","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5WSt8iZHMhZ63YOWDR6TybVru-V0TQsidPzzgFFmsvx0nDL8GoN7DZUMAKD2cAlRzF22pT-qFyk_Ph-JrJv_","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/feHiAzzqheWeVgt82s5EWEkW9_xnZQ6Az3-pVgfCDvefwsLwv2H7K3BJaerBX-ZmVNT-wEHPuZ3sCpSMLgblKjg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5_NfYSfdnnUSvxB7zkW229yrlKJP1-MOyBcESlB8zZwEGzpKM2KKf55-xwRhR4wYjdLi4is-oN2z1547EZ-P","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jViP0za82Y_vlAwmZXLqswzlqhyQLBf_2H8wnaAG2HBxBkwSYkOF0QNIkUoqf0kcJxfU6rMG_Sra0cCy_bZqtg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QksnF3Lx0xvC04kbPm5i2bdr9btAEFMprJVf_5WwaLmIJS4JNSBYYVQE1kXKnWIdpcQc4qmoRn39Lyq0JW1Khg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NeQFJb02VSFecImXhLGXoaO3UZEpqo-he6i8rOtrqr8oTLmXYYAOh-mPp0TcSuy1VBi-bCbASx9h1TKP9lYT","htt